Server init.

>> message := ['this is a string to be encrypted!'].
>> key := ['secret123!'].
>> vault := Isisefo okusha: ['myvault'].

>> encrypted := vault bethela: message ukhiye: key.
>> decrypted := vault susa-ukubethela: encrypted ukhiye: key.

Okuphumayo 
bhala: ['Message:'], umugqa-omusha
bhala: message, umugqa-omusha
bhala: ['Decrypted:'], umugqa-omusha
bhala: decrypted, umugqa-omusha.
